      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm thinking about going to kenya next month but i've been seeing stuff in the news about protests and stuff. can you give me a quick rundown of what's going on politically there so i know what to expect, but mostly just tell me if it's gonna be safe for a tourist?",
